{"4465900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Inhuman Echoes", "steam_appid": 4465900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a Pre-Historic survival horror in first person, where you explore dark forests, caves, swamps and forgotten temples, and defend yourself from humans and monsters by shooting arrows, or fighting head on with stone axes, spears, knifes, and clubs from the Neolithic era. Your arrows are limited and your melee weapons break, so you must manage resources wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an exiled tribal hunter in the Neolithic Age, pursued by cannibals through his entire adult life, in a journey through ruins older than humanity itself to find out the dark truth about Earth's former masters, and end the lives of his tormentors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use arrows, stone axes, and spears to survive the desperate struggle against cannibals and the eldritch remnants of ages past, stay in the light and pay attention to breathing and footsteps coming from the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the cosmic secrets left behind by the inhuman masters of the occult before the rise of humanity, and struggle against it's remnants.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a Pre-Historic survival horror in first person, where you explore dark forests, caves, swamps and forgotten temples, and defend yourself from humans and monsters by shooting arrows, or fighting head on with stone axes, spears, knifes, and clubs from the Neolithic era. Your arrows are limited and your melee weapons break, so you must manage resources wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an exiled tribal hunter in the Neolithic Age, pursued by cannibals through his entire adult life, in a journey through ruins older than humanity itself to find out the dark truth about Earth's former masters, and end the lives of his tormentors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use arrows, stone axes, and spears to survive the desperate struggle against cannibals and the eldritch remnants of ages past, stay in the light and pay attention to breathing and footsteps coming from the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the cosmic secrets left behind by the inhuman masters of the occult before the rise of humanity, and struggle against it's remnants.</p>", "short_description": "Look over your shoulder, pay attention to their footsteps, they are hidden in the dark of forests, swamps and caves, waiting to catch you off guard, they just keep coming back no matter how much of them you kill. Your only hope is to delve deep into the older than human ruins they come from.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465900/fe71dbf8c21f40b6c6fb6aabd2c7f13d53dd44ed/header.jpg?t=1774868781", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465900/568736f99ac710b7ce4c6a2c0c947ba458bb8491/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774868781", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465900/568736f99ac710b7ce4c6a2c0c947ba458bb8491/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774868781", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual-Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8800GT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual-Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Me